      description: "Step-by-step instructions for building a new Progressive Web App (PWA) or integrating PWA compliance into a web application (Vite or Next.js) with offline capabilities, service workers, Web App Manifests, icon assets, and in-app install prompts. Use when building a new PWA or adding PWA support, offline capabilities, or installability to a web app."
    }
