  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Data Models**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining the data models within `src/types/aos.ts`. I\'ve begun reviewing the essential models we need. Right now, I\'m working on the `Account` and `Device` models, specifying fields like `id`, `name`, `email`, and `tier` for the former, and `id`, `name`, and `type` for the latter, and how it is a mobile phone. I\'m aiming for concise and clear definitions.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Models**\n\nI\'ve been expanding the data models in `src/types/aos.ts`, adding more complex types. I\'ve defined `Device` including fields such as `type`, `authorized_at`, `status`, `last_seen`, and `capabilities`. Also I\'ve detailed the `SkinManifest`, outlining various components such as `schema_version`, `skin_id`, and `views`, with details on the nested `WidgetDefinition`. I\'ve also defined the `Proposal` model. My goal is clear, comprehensive models.\n\n\n**Defining Activity and UX**\n\nI\'m now detailing `ActivityEvent`, with fields like `id`, `timestamp`, `actor_device_id`, and `type`, specifying possible statuses like `queued`, `running`, and `completed`. I am also working on `UserExperienceConfig` including the `skin_id`, `display_name`, and `widget_order`, focusing on how custom settings are structured, and how the device will use the schema. I\'m aiming for clarity in these new models.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_57148"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * @license\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\n * AOS Product v0.1 \342\200\224 Authoritative DTO & Contract Definitions\\n */\\n\\nexport interface AOSAccount {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  tenant_id: string;\\n  plan: \'Starter\' | \'Professional\' | \'Fleet Enterprise\';\\n  status: \'active\' | \'suspended\';\\n  created_at: string;\\n  monthly_token_usage: number;\\n  monthly_token_limit: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport type DeviceType = \'mobile_phone\' | \'tablet\' | \'vehicle_display\' | \'workstation\';\\n\\nexport interface AOSDevice {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  type: DeviceType;\\n  platform: string;\\n  authorized_at: string;\\n  last_seen: string;\\n  status: \'active\' | \'standby\' | \'revoked\';\\n  is_current: boolean;\\n  permitted_capabilities: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WidgetDefinition {\\n  id: string;\\n  component_type:\\n    | \'metric-group\'\\n    | \'record-list\'\\n    | \'intent-composer\'\\n    | \'activity-list\'\\n    | \'route-display\'\\n    | \'notes-board\';\\n  title: string;\\n  data_source: string;\\n  config?: Record<string, unknown>;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SkinViewDefinition {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  icon?: string;\\n  widget_ids: string[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface SkinManifest {\\n  schema_version: \'aos.skin.v0.1\';\\n  skin_id: string;\\n  display_name: string;\\n  version: string;\\n  kind: \'demo\' | \'production\';\\n  description: string;\\n  tagline: string;\\n  icon: string;\\n  primary_color: string;\\n  accent_color: string;\\n  required_capabilities: string[];\\n  requested_permissions: string[];\\n  views: SkinViewDefinition[];\\n  widgets: WidgetDefinition[];\\n  installed: boolean;\\n  is_active: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ProposedStep {\\n  step_number: number;\\n  title: string;\\n  description: string;\\n  permission_required: string;\\n  risk_level: \'low\' | \'medium\' | \'high\';\\n 