  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing The Widgets**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the widgets, starting with `src/components/widgets/MetricGroupWidget.tsx`. This will handle the Field Service metrics, including \"Keikat t\303\244n\303\244\303\244n,\" \"Kriittiset,\" \"Valmiina,\" and \"Varaosasaatavuus.\" I also plan to incorporate Driver-related metrics soon. This is a critical building block.\n\n\n**Designing Widget Structure**\n\nI\'m now refining the design for several widget types. The `RecordListWidget` will display field service jobs, driver stops, and DMS goals with specific data points. The `RouteDisplayWidget` will provide a detailed next-stop card, including entry instructions, a contextual recommended action, and a \"Tarkastele ehdotusta\" button. I\'m focusing on a clean, unboxed text design.\n\n\n**Adding New Components**\n\nI\'m now integrating an intent composer widget with voice entry, incorporating quick prompts and intent interpretation. I\'m also adding a notes board widget for shared, persistent notes. Additionally, I\'ve got a widget renderer in the works to validate component types and render them with data. Time to build `src/components/widgets/MetricGroupWidget.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_126637"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * @license\\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\\n * AOS MetricGroupWidget \342\200\224 High-legibility tabular metrics (Zero-pill, WCAG AA)\\n */\\n\\nimport React from \'react\';\\nimport { WidgetDefinition } from \'../../types/aos\';\\n\\ninterface MetricGroupWidgetProps {\\n  widget: WidgetDefinition;\\n  skinId: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const MetricGroupWidget: React.FC<MetricGroupWidgetProps> = ({\\n  widget,\\n  skinId,\\n}) => {\\n  let metrics: Array<{ label: string; value: string; subtext: string; change?: string }> = [];\\n\\n  if (skinId === \'field-service-demo\') {\\n    metrics = [\\n      { label: \'T\303\244n\303\244\303\244n keikkoja\', value: \'3\', subtext: \'Kaikki aikataulutettu\' },\\n      { label: \'Kriittiset ty\303\266t\', value: \'1\', subtext: \'Yale Doorman L3S\' },\\n      { label: \'Varaosasaatavuus\', value: \'100%\', subtext: \'Autovarasto tarkastettu\' },\\n      { label: \'Toteutunut SLA\', value: \'98.4%\', subtext: \'Tavoite > 95%\' },\\n    ];\\n  } else if (skinId === \'driver-demo\') {\\n    metrics = [\\n      { label: \'Pys\303\244hdyksi\303\244\', value: \'4\', subtext: \'1 suoritettu \302\267 3 j\303\244ljell\303\244\' },\\n      { label: \'Seuraava ETA\', value: \'10:40\', subtext: \'It\303\244merenkatu 11\' },\\n      { label: \'Akun varaustaso\', value: \'74%\', subtext: \'Toimintamatka 260 km\' },\\n      { label: \'Ajoaikaa j\303\244ljell\303\244\', value: \'3 h 40 min\', subtext: \'Lakis\303\244\303\244teinen lepoaika ok\' },\\n    ];\\n  } else {\\n    metrics = [\\n      { label: \'Aktiiviset tavoitteet\', value: \'3\', subtext: \'DMS Goal Tree linkitetty\' },\\n      { label: \'Toteutusaste\', value: \'84%\', subtext: \'Q4 operatiivinen SLA\' },\\n      { label: \'AOS Token-k\303\244ytt\303\266\', value: \'14.2k\', subtext: \'Kiinti\303\266 100k / kk\' },\\n      { label: \'Valtuutetut laitteet\', value: \'4\', subtext: \'Kaikki synkronoitu\' },\\n    ];\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-xs\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3.5\\\">\\n        <h3 className=\\\"font-display font-semibold text-sm text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n          {widget.title}\\n        </h3>\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">\\n          <span>{widget.data_source}</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4\\\">\\n        {metrics.map((item, idx) => (\\n          <div\\n            key={idx}\\n            className=\\\"p-3 sm:p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-750/70\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-medium truncate\\\">\\n              {item.label}\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-display text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1 tabular-nums\\\">\\n              {item.value}\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 truncate\\\">\\n              {item.subtext}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        ))}\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create MetricGroupWidget component\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/widgets/MetricGroupWidget.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating MetricGroupWidget\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create MetricGroupWidget.tsx\"}"
